cture/fluid-integration-34","page_id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#files-and-references","content":"| File                                      | Purpose                                                                             |\n| ----------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `curvine-docker/fluid/generate_config.py` | Parses Fluid runtime JSON and writes the Curvine TOML config for CacheRuntime pods. |","locale":"en","table":"table-1"},"37":{"id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-35","page_id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#files-and-references","content":"| File                                   | Purpose                                                                                         |\n| -------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `curvine-docker/fluid/config-parse.py` | Parses Fluid runtime JSON and writes the Curvine TOML config plus mount script for ThinRuntime. |","locale":"en","table":"table-1"},"38":{"id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-36","page_id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#files-and-references","content":"| File                               | Purpose                                                                                    |\n| ---------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `curvine-docker/fluid/mountUfs.sh` | Mounts the Dataset UFS paths into Curvine and reports mounted Curvine paths back to Fluid. |","locale":"en","table":"table-1"},"39":{"id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-37","page_id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#files-and-references","content":"| File                                    | Purpose                                      |\n| --------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `curvine-docker/fluid/reportSummary.sh` | Reports Curvine cache summary JSON to Fluid. |","locale":"en","table":"table-1"},"40":{"id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-38","page_id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#files-and-references","content":"| File                                  | Purpose                |\n| ------------------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| `curvine-docker/fluid/cache-runtime/` | CacheRuntime examples. |","locale":"en","table":"table-1"},"41":{"id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-39","page_id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#files-and-references","content":"| File                                 | Purpose               |\n| ------------------------------------ | --------------------- |\n| `curvine-docker/fluid/thin-runtime/` | ThinRuntime examples. |","locale":"en","table":"table-1"},"42":{"id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-40","page_id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#files-and-references","content":"Useful Fluid references:","locale":"en"},"43":{"id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-41","page_id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#files-and-references","content":"Generic CacheRuntime integration","locale":"en"},"44":{"id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-42","page_id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#files-and-references","content":"ReportSu