/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-13","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#example-resources","content":"`volumeClaimTemplates` entry named `data`","locale":"en"},"2188":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-14","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#example-resources","content":"`storageClassName: curvine-sc`","locale":"en"},"2189":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-15","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#example-resources","content":"per-pod mount path `/usr/share/nginx/html`","locale":"en"},"2190":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-16","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#what-happens","content":"Kubernetes creates one PVC per pod from `volumeClaimTemplates`.","locale":"en"},"2191":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-17","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#what-happens","content":"Each pod writes its hostname, timestamp, and PVC name into `index.html`.","locale":"en"},"2192":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-18","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#what-happens","content":"The CSI controller dynamically provisions a Curvine directory for each PVC.","locale":"en"},"2193":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-19","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#what-happens","content":"The CSI node plugin mounts each PVC into the matching pod.","locale":"en"},"2194":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-20","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#what-happens","content":"Because each PVC is distinct, each pod gets independent application data even though all of them use the same CSI driver and `StorageClass`.","locale":"en"},"2195":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-21","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#verify-pvc-separation","content":"Check the rendered content inside each replica:","locale":"en"},"2196":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-22","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#verify-pvc-separation","content":"The output should differ by pod hostname and PVC name.","locale":"en"},"2197":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-23","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#check-persistence","content":"If `retained` is still present after the pod is recreated, the StatefulSet is correctly reusing the original PVC.","locale":"en"},"2198":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-24","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#notes","content":"The example uses `ReadWriteOnce` in `volumeClaimTemplates`, which matches the common StatefulSet pattern of one writer per replica.","locale":"en"},"2199":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-25","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#notes","content":"The dynamically created Curvine directory is still derived from the StorageClass `fs-path` plus the generated PV name, not from the pod ordinal directly.","locale":"en"},"2200":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-26","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#notes","content":"FUSE reuse still happens at the node level based on `master-addrs + fs-path`; the pod-level data isolation comes from the subdirectory that each PVC points to.","locale":"en"},"2201":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver","type":"page","content":"K8S CSI Driver","breadcrumbs":["Documents","User Manuals","K8S CSI Driver"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver","locale":"en"},"2202":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","type":"page","content":"Cache","breadcrumbs":["Documents","User Manuals","Key Features"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","locale":"en"},"2203":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-0","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#1-what-is-curvine","content":"1. What Is Curvine?","locale":"en"},"2204":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-1","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#2-core-features","content":"2. Core Features","locale":"en"},"2205":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-2","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#3-local-disk-like-user-experience","content":"3. Local-Disk-Like User Experience","locale":"en"},"2206":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-3","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#31-m