"3103":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-27","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#选择接入方式","content":"| 模式           | 适用场景                                      | Fluid 会启动什么                            | 主要资源                                         |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| CacheRuntime | 希望 Fluid 在 Kubernetes 中管理一套 Curvine 缓存集群。 | Curvine master、worker、client/FUSE Pod。 | `CacheRuntimeClass`、`Dataset`、`CacheRuntime` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"3104":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-28","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#选择接入方式","content":"| 模式          | 适用场景                                   | Fluid 会启动什么               | 主要资源                                         |\n| ----------- | -------------------------------------- | ------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| ThinRuntime | 已经有一套 Curvine 集群，只希望 Fluid 把它挂进业务 Pod。 | 只启动 Curvine FUSE runtime。 | `ThinRuntimeProfile`、`Dataset`、`ThinRuntime` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"3105":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-29","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#选择接入方式","content":"大多数新用户应选择 CacheRuntime。ThinRuntime 更适合 Curvine 已经独立运维的场景。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3106":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-30","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#文件与参考资料","content":"Curvine 的 Fluid 物料在 Curvine 源码中：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3107":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-31","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#文件与参考资料","content":"| 文件                                   | 用途                                       |\n| ------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `curvine-docker/deploy/Dockerfile_*` | 构建普通 `curvine` 运行时镜像；Fluid 支持已经包含在这个镜像里。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"3108":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-32","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#文件与参考资料","content":"| 文件                                    | 用途                                                            |\n| ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `curvine-docker/deploy/entrypoint.sh` | 启动普通 Curvine 服务；如果检测到 Fluid 运行时模式，则转到 `/fluid-entrypoint.sh`。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"3109":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-33","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#文件与参考资料","content":"| 文件                                   | 用途                                                                             |\n| ------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `curvine-docker/fluid/entrypoint.sh` | Fluid 入口脚本，会作为 `/fluid-entrypoint.sh` 打进主镜像，并判断 CacheRuntime / ThinRuntime 模式。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"3110":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-34","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#文件与参考资料","content":"| 文件                                        | 用途                                                           |\n| ----------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n