ype":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-创建-cacheruntimeclass","content":"这个 class 定义了 Fluid 如何启动 Curvine 的各个角色：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3136":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-60","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-创建-cacheruntimeclass","content":"| 角色       | Kubernetes 工作负载 | 作用                       |\n| -------- | --------------- | ------------------------ |\n| `master` | `StatefulSet`   | Curvine 元数据和 journal 服务。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-2"},"3137":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-61","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-创建-cacheruntimeclass","content":"| 角色       | Kubernetes 工作负载 | 作用    |\n| -------- | --------------- | ----- |\n| `worker` | `StatefulSet`   | 缓存存储。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-2"},"3138":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-62","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-创建-cacheruntimeclass","content":"| 角色       | Kubernetes 工作负载 | 作用                  |\n| -------- | --------------- | ------------------- |\n| `client` | `DaemonSet`     | 面向业务 Pod 的 FUSE 挂载。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-2"},"3139":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-63","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-创建-cacheruntimeclass","content":"这个 class 还定义了 `executionEntries.mountUFS`。Fluid 会调用这个入口，让 Curvine 在服务 Dataset 前先挂载底层 UFS 路径。Curvine 镜像中的脚本路径是：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3140":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-64","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-创建-cacheruntimeclass","content":"该脚本会读取 `FLUID_RUNTIME_CONFIG_PATH`，对非 Curvine 原生路径执行 `cv mount`，对 `curvine://` 原生路径直接跳过并返回路径。最后输出 Fluid 需要的 JSON：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3141":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-65","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-创建-cacheruntimeclass","content":"这个 class 还定义了 `executionEntries.ReportSummary`。Fluid 会在 master Pod 中调用这个入口，把缓存状态刷新到 Dataset Status。Curvine 镜像中的脚本路径是：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3142":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-66","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-创建-cacheruntimeclass","content":"该脚本会执行：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3143":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-67","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-创建-cacheruntimeclass","content":"它只向 stdout 输出严格 JSON，格式遵循 Fluid 的 ReportSummary 输出要求：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3144":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-68","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-创建-cacheruntimeclass","content":"Curvine 只上报 master 能低成本返回的值：已缓存字节数、缓存容量和文件数。`ufsTotal`、`cachedPercentage`、`cacheHitRatio` 暂时保持为 `0`，直到 Curvine 有权威的 UFS 总量和命中率元数据。这样可以避免把“缓存容量使用率”误写成“Dataset 缓存百分比”。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3145":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-69","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#2-创建-dataset-和-cacheruntime","content":"从这个文件开始：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3146":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-70","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#2-创建-dataset-和-cacheruntime","content":"应用：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3147":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-