和 service 名称。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-3"},"3161":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-85","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#cacheruntime-配置如何生成","content":"| Curvine 配置        | 来源                                    |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `worker.data_dir` | worker options 或 Fluid `tieredStore`。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-3"},"3162":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-86","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#cacheruntime-配置如何生成","content":"| Curvine 配置            | 来源                       |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------ |\n| `client.master_addrs` | 生成的 master RPC endpoint。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-3"},"3163":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-87","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#cacheruntime-配置如何生成","content":"| Curvine 配置      | 来源                        |\n| --------------- | ------------------------- |\n| `fuse.mnt_path` | Fluid client target path。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-3"},"3164":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-88","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#cacheruntime-配置如何生成","content":"所以，`FLUID_RUNTIME_CONFIG_PATH` 对 master、worker、client Pod 都很关键。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3165":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-89","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#cacheruntime-dataload","content":"`DataLoad` 用来把 Dataset 中的一个或多个路径预热到缓存里。对 Curvine 来说，DataLoad Job 最终应执行类似命令：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3166":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-90","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#cacheruntime-dataload","content":"这里要分清两件事：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3167":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-91","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#cacheruntime-dataload","content":"`CacheRuntimeClass.dataOperationSpecs` 定义“这个缓存运行时如何执行 DataLoad”。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3168":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-92","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#cacheruntime-dataload","content":"`DataLoad` 资源定义“要给哪个 Dataset 预热哪些路径”。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3169":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-93","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"在已有 `CacheRuntimeClass` 顶层增加 `dataOperationSpecs`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3170":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-94","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"只需要增加这个字段。不要为了打开 DataLoad 去改 `topology`、`fileSystemType` 或 master/worker/client 定义。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3171":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-95","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"不要把这段直接当成完整生产命令复制使用，除非你的 DataLoad 镜像或脚本会在执行 `cv load` 前生成 `/etc/curvine.toml`。Curvine 示例 `curvine-docker/fluid/cache-runtime/curvine-cache-runtime-class.yaml` 已经包含这部分逻辑。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3172":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-96","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"Fluid 会把这些环境变量注入 DataLoad Job：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3173":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-97","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"| 环境变量                      | 含义       |\n| ------------------------- | -------- |\n| `FLUID_DATALOAD_METADATA` | 是否加载元数据。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"3174":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-98","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"| 环境变量                       | 含义                   |\n| -------------------------- | -------------------- |\n| `FLUID_DATALOAD_DATA_PATH` | 要加载的路径，多个路径用 `:` 连接。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"3175":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-99","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"| 环境变量                           | 含义                    |\n| ------------------------------ | --------------------- |\n| `FLUID_DATALOAD_PATH_REPLICAS` | 每个路径的副本数，多个值用 `:` 连接。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"3176":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-100","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"Curvine 的 CacheRuntimeClass 示例会在 `dataOperationSpecs` 里内联 DataLoad 脚本，因为 Fluid 会把数据操作作为短生命周期 Job 执行。脚本会先从 Fluid runtime JSON 生成 Curvine 配置；如果这个文件没有挂载，再依次回退到 Dataset 元数据、Pod label，以及 `<dataset>-load` 这类 DataLoad 名称规则。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3177":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-101","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"当 Fluid 传入 `/minio` 这样的 Dataset 内路径时，脚本会读取 Curvine mount 元数据，把它解析成真正需要加载的 Curvine source，再执行 `cv load --watch`。这样 DataLoad 和 `mountUFS` 的语义是一致的。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3178":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-102","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#2-创建-dataload-资源","content":"示例：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3179":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-103","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#2-创建-dataload-资源","content":"应用：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3180":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-104","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#2-创建-dataload-资源","content":"`spec.dataset` 指定 Dataset。`spec.target[].path` 指定要预热的 Dataset 内路径。Fluid 会把这些路径通过 `FLUID_DATALOAD_DATA_PATH` 传给 Job。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3181":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-105","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#3-检查-dataload-job","content":"只有每个目标路径的 `cv load --watch` 都成功退出，DataLoad 才算成功。如果 `cv load --watch` 返回错误，Job 应该失败，这样 Fluid 才能把问题暴露出来。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3182":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-106","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#关于-etcfluidconfigruntimejson","content":"Fluid chart `helm-chart-fluid-1.1.0-alpha.10` 会把 runtime config 文件挂载进 CacheRuntime DataLoad Pod，并设置 `FLUID_RUNTIME_CONFIG_PATH`。使用这个版本时，Curvine DataLoad 可以像 master、worker、client Pod 一样生成配置。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3183":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-107","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#关于-etcfluidconfigruntimejson","content":"更旧的 Fluid 版本或自定义 DataLoad 模板，可能只设置了 `FLUID_RUNTIME_CONFIG_PATH`，但没有把 runtime config 文件挂载进 DataLoad Pod。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3184":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-108","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#关于-etcfluidconfigruntimejson","content":"如果你的 DataLoad 命令需要读取 runtime JSON，请同时确认两件事：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3185":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-109","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#关于-etcfluidconfigruntimejson","content":"DataLoad Pod 中设置了 `FLUID_RUNTIME_CONFIG_PATH`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3186":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-110","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#关于-etcfluidconfigruntimejson","content":"DataLoad Pod 内这个文件真实存在。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3187":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-111","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#关于-etcfluidconfigruntimejson","content":"如果文件不存在，Curvine 示例会按下面顺序尝试 fallback：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3188":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-112","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#关于-etcfluidconfigruntimejson","content":"`CURVINE_DATALOAD_DATASET`、`FLUID_DATASET_NAME` 或 `CURVINE_DATALOAD_MASTER_HOST`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3189":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-113","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#关于-etcfluidconfigruntim