roduction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#概述","content":"概述","locale":"zh-cn"},"3232":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-1","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#master","content":"Master","locale":"zh-cn"},"3233":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-2","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#leader主-master","content":"Leader（主 Master）","locale":"zh-cn"},"3234":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-3","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#standby-master备-master","content":"Standby Master（备 Master）","locale":"zh-cn"},"3235":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-4","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#raft","content":"Raft","locale":"zh-cn"},"3236":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-5","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#workers","content":"Workers","locale":"zh-cn"},"3237":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-6","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#注册与心跳","content":"注册与心跳","locale":"zh-cn"},"3238":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-7","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#块存储","content":"块存储","locale":"zh-cn"},"3239":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-8","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#复制可选","content":"复制（可选）","locale":"zh-cn"},"3240":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-9","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#client","content":"Client","locale":"zh-cn"},"3241":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-10","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#读路径","content":"读路径","locale":"zh-cn"},"3242":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-11","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#写路径","content":"写路径","locale":"zh-cn"},"3243":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-12","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#小结","content":"小结","locale":"zh-cn"},"3244":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-13","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","content":"本文基于源码说明 Curvine 的核心组件与数据流：**Master**（元数据与 Raft）、**Worker**（块存储）、**Client**（读写路径）。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3245":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-14","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#概述","content":"Curvine 是分布式文件缓存层。**Master** 负责元数据与块调度；**Worker** 存储块数据并响应读写；**Client**（FUSE、SDK、CLI、S3 网关）向 Master 请求元数据、向 Worker 请求数据。元数据通过 **Raft** 复制以实现高可用。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3246":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-15","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#master","content":"Master 是控制面：维护文件系统元数据（目录树、文件 inode、块位置）、管理 Worker 注册、为写入分配块。为实现高可用，多个 Master 节点组成 **Raft 组**；只有 **Leader** 对外提供元数据写 RPC；**Follower** 通过回放日志与 Leader 状态保持一致。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3247":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-16","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#leader主-master","content":"**职责**：Raft Leader 是唯一接受元数据变更 RPC 的节点（创建文件、添加块、重命名、删除、挂载/卸载等）。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3248":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-17","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#leader主-master","content":"**日志**：每次元数据变更都会落盘为 **journal 条目**（如 `Mkdir`、`CreateFile`、`AddBlock`、`CompleteFile`、`Rename`、`Delete`、`Mount`、`UnMount`）。Leader 将条目追加到 Raft 日志；提交后在内存目录树（`FsDir`）上应用。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3249":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-18","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#leader主-master","content":"**组件**：`MasterHandler` 处理 RPC；`MasterFilesystem` 与 `FsDir` 维护目录/文件与块映射；`JournalWriter` 写日志；`WorkerManager` 管理 Worker 与块分布；`MountManager` 管理 UFS 挂载点。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3250":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-19","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#standby-master备-master","content":"**职责**：Raft Follower **不**处理元数据写 RPC。它们接收 Leader 已提交的日志条目并 **回放**，以保持元数据副本一致。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3251":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-20","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#standby-master备-master","content":"**回放**：`JournalLoader` 将每条已提交的 `JournalEntry` 应用到本地 `FsDir`（如 `mkdir`、`create_file`、`add_block`、`complete_file`、`rename`、`delete`、`mount`、`unmount`），使备节点状态与 Leader 一致。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3252":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-21","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#standby-master备-master","content":"**快照**：支持 Raft 快照；存在快照时可从快照恢复元数据，无需从头回放。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3253":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-22","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#raft","content":"**存储**：元数据日志与 Raft 状态使用 **RocksDB**（`RocksLogStorage`）。Journal 作为应用负载承载在 Raft 日志条目中。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3254":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-23","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#raft","content":"**角色**：`MasterMonitor` 暴露当前节点是否为主：仅当 Raft 角色为 **Leader** 时 `is_active()` 为 true。客户端或上层应将元数据写请求路由到当前 Leader（例如通过集群配置或路由解析）。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3255":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-24","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#raft","content":"**故障转移**：Leader 宕机后，Raft 选举新 Leader；新 Leader 继续应用日志并对外提供元数据服务。通过日志回放或快照追齐的备节点可参与选举。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3256":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-25","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#workers","content":"Worker 负责 **块数据** 的存储与块读写 RPC。不保存文件系统元数据，只管理以块 ID 标识的块。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3257":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-26","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#注册与心跳","content":"Worker 向 Master **注册**并周期性发送 **心跳**，携带存储信息（`HeartbeatStatus`：Start、Running、End）。Master 的 `WorkerManager` 维护 `WorkerMap` 与 `BlockMap`（块与 Worker 的对应关系）。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3258":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-27","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#注册与心跳","content":"Master 据此为写入 **分配块**（如通过 Worker 选择策略：随机、轮询、基于负载、本地等），并在读请求时返回块位置。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3259":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-28","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#块存储","content":"每个 Worker 运行 **BlockStore**，底层为 **BlockDataset**：块按集群与存储策略落在本地存储（内存、SSD、HDD）。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3260":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-29","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#块存储","content":"**读路径**：Worker 的 `ReadHandler` 接收块读 RPC，打开块文件并返回数据（可选读前向、sendfile 等优化）。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3261":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-30","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#块存储","content":"**写路径**：Worker 的写处理逻辑接收块写 RPC，将数据写入 BlockStore，并按请求完成或中止块。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3262":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-31","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#复制可选","content":"Master 可运行 **块复制** 流程（`MasterReplicationManager`）：在需要多副本时，由 Master 协调将块数据从某一 Worker 复制到其他 Worker。复制可配置（如并发上限、开关）。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3263":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-32","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#client","content":"Client 指使用 Curvine 文件系统的任何一方：**FUSE**、**Rust/Java/Python SDK**、**CLI**（`cv`）或 **S3 网关**。它们都向 **Master** 要元数据、向 **Worker** 要块数据。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3264":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-33","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#读路径","content":"**元数据**：Client 向 Master 请求文件元数据与 **块位置**（哪些 Worker 持有哪些块 ID、偏移、长度）。Master 返回 `FileBlocks`（文件状态 + 块位置列表）。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3265":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-34","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#读路径","content":"**数据**：Client 通过块读 RPC 从对应 Worker 读取块数据。可配置 **并行读** 与 **读前向**（chunk 大小、slice 大小、读前向长度）。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3266":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-35","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#读路径","content":"**缓存命中**：若路径为 Curvine 原生文件（非 UFS 挂载），数据按上述方式从 Worker 读取。若路径在 **UFS 挂载** 下，则 统一文件系统 与 缓存行为 生效：在缓存有效时从 Curvine 返回，未命中时从 UFS 读取（可配置 TTL 下的自动缓存）。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3267":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-36","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#写路径","content":"写行为由 **挂载写类型**（UFS 挂载）或原生 Curvine 路径决定：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3268":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-37","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#写路径","content":"**分配块**：Client 向 Master 申请新块。Master 选择 Worker（及副本），将块分配记入日志（如 `AddBlock`、`CompleteFile`），并返回块位置给 Client。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3269":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-38","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#写路径","content":"**写数据**：Client 通过块写 RPC 将数据发往指定 Worker。Worker 将数据持久化到 BlockStore。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3270":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-39","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#写路径","content":"**写类型**（UFS 挂载路径见 数据编排 — 挂载模式）：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3271":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-40","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#写路径","content":"**Cache**：仅写入 Curvine（Worker），不写 UFS。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3272":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-41","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#写路径","content":"**Through**：仅写 UFS，绕过缓存。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3273":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-42","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#写路径","content":"**AsyncThrough**（默认）：先写 Curvine 后立即返回，再异步同步到 UFS。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3274":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-43","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#写路径","content":"**CacheThrough**：同步写入 Curvine 与 UFS 后返回。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3275":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-44","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#写路径","content":"原生 Curvine 路径（非 UFS）的写入直接落 Worker 并由 Master 记入日志；多副本由 Master/Worker 的复制逻辑在配置开启时处理。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3276":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-45","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#小结","content":"| 组件                  | 职责                                            |\n| ------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| **Master (Leader)** | 元数据（FsDir）、写日志、块分配、Worker 映射、挂载表；处理所有元数据 RPC。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"3277":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-46","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#小结","content":"| 组件                    | 职责                                              |\n| --------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| **Master (Follower)** | 回放 Raft 日志（JournalLoader）以同步 FsDir；不处理元数据写 RPC。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"3278":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-47","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#小结","content":"| 组件       | 职责                                         |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **Raft** | 复制 journal 条目；Leader 选举与故障转移；RocksDB 日志存储。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"3279":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-48","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#小结","content":"| 组件         | 职责                                                |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Worker** | 块存储（BlockStore/BlockDataset）、块读写 RPC、向 Master 心跳。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"3280":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-49","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#小结","content":"| 组件         | 职责                                                        |\n| ---------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Client** | 从 Master 获取元数据与块位置；从 Worker 读写块数据；UFS 挂载下按写类型与缓存/一致性策略执行。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"3281":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction-50","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/introduction#小结","content":"部署拓扑与启动顺序见 部署架构。UFS 与缓存语义见 数据编排 与 缓存。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3282":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","type":"page","content":"Curvine 元数据架构说明","breadcrumbs":["Documents","Architecture"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","locale":"zh-cn"},"3283":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-0","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#1-设计目标与选型","content":"1. 设计目标与选型","locale":"zh-cn"},"3284":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-1","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#3-raft-协议保障多节点数据一致的核心机制","content":"3. Raft 协议：保障多节点数据一致的核心机制","locale":"zh-cn"},"3285":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-2","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#4-leader-优先写兼顾速度与一致性的巧妙权衡","content":"4. Leader 优先写：兼顾速度与一致性的巧妙权衡","locale":"zh-cn"},"3286":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-3","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#5-日志批处理优化进一步提升高并发吞吐量","content":"5. 日志批处理优化：进一步提升高并发吞吐量","locale":"zh-cn"},"3287":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-4","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#6-选型取舍为何不采用-tidbredis-等外部数据库","content":"6. 选型取舍：为何不采用 TiDB、Redis 等外部数据库","locale":"zh-cn"},"3288":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-5","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#7-fs-mode-模式与-ufs-协同保障数据兜底安全","content":"7. fs-mode 模式：与 UFS 协同，保障数据兜底安全","locale":"zh-cn"},"3289":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-6","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#8-架构小结","content":"8. 架构小结","locale":"zh-cn"},"3290":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-7","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","content":"元数据是分布式文件系统的核心组件，相当于系统的“导航中枢”，主要负责管理文件/目录的命名空间、存储位置、大小权限、修改时间等关键信息，其读写速度、存储容量和数据一致性，直接决定了整个分布式文件系统的运行性能、稳定性和可用性。Curvine 结合分布式存储领域的最佳实践，经过多方案对比验证，最终选用「Raft 协议 + RocksDB 数据库」的核心组合来管理元数据，既能满足高并发场景下的低延迟需求，又能支撑海量元数据存储，同时保障多节点数据一致，以下是简化且完整的核心说明。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3291":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-8","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#1-设计目标与选型","content":"Curvine 元数据架构的核心设计目标的明确且聚焦，主要围绕四大核心需求展开：一是支持千万至百亿级文件/目录的元数据存储，适配海量小文件、大文件混合的存储场景；二是保障高并发读写场景下的低延迟，应对频繁的文件创建、删除、修改等高频操作；三是实现分布式集群多节点数据一致，避免出现“本地修改后其他节点不可见”的问题；四是兼顾运维便捷性与成本可控，降低部署、监控和故障恢复的复杂度。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3292":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-9","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#1-设计目标与选型","content":"在选型过程中，技术团队对比了 HDFS NameNode、TiDB、Redis 及独立 Raft 集群等多种主流方案，最终确定「Raft + RocksDB」的组合架构，核心考量有三点：其一，二者均经过大规模生产场景验证，工程成熟度高，稳定性有保障，广泛应用于各类分布式存储系统；其二，RocksDB 基于 LSM-Tree 架构，具备高并发写入、高压缩比、海量存储的优势，非常适合存储元数据这类高频读写、海量小条目数据；其三，Raft 协议能高效解决分布式集群的一致性问题，通过简单清晰的机制实现多节点数据同步，避免单点故障，兼顾一致性与性能。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3293":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-10","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#1-设计目标与选型","content":"为了实现“速度、存储、一致性”三者平衡，架构采用「三层分工」模式，各层各司其职、协同配合，具体分工如下：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3294":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-11","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#1-设计目标与选型","content":"| 层次    | 核心职责                                                 | 设计动机                                                                              |\n| ----- | ---------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 内存目录树 | 专门处理路径解析、目录列举、文件夹关联等高频操作，仅存储目录核心结构信息（文件夹名称、父文件夹关联关系） | 内存读写速度远快于磁盘，将高频操作的核心信息放在内存中，可将目录查询、路径匹配等操作延迟控制在微秒级；同时仅维护轻量目录结构，大幅降低内存占用，避免内存资源浪费。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"3295":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-12","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#1-设计目标与选型","content":"| 层次                    | 核心职责                                                  | 设计动机                                                                              |\n| --------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 元数据 RocksDB（Inode 引擎） | 持久化存储所有文件/目录的完整详细信息，包括文件大小、权限、修改时间、数据块位置，以及目录关联的完整关系等 | 承接海量元数据的持久化存储需求，通过「列族」机制将不同类型的元数据分类存储（如文件属性、目录关系分开管理），提升读写效率和管理便捷性，同时适配高频元数据修改场景。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"3296":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-13","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#1-设计目标与选型","content":"| 层次              | 核心职责                                        | 设计动机                                                      |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Raft 日志 RocksDB | 专门存储所有元数据修改操作的日志（创建、删除、修改等），按操作顺序记录，用于多节点同步 | 与业务元数据存储完全隔离，避免日志存储与业务读写相互影响，同时便于日志的同步、压缩、清理和故障恢复，减少性能损耗。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"3297":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-14","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#1-设计目标与选型","content":"内存目录树和 RocksDB 并非独立运行，而是形成“内存管快、磁盘管存”的协同模式，既保证高频操作的速度，又实现海量数据的存储，核心协同逻辑如下：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3298":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-15","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#1-设计目标与选型","content":"**内存目录树**：聚焦高频操作的极致速度，仅存储目录最核心的结构信息（文件夹名称、父文件夹ID、子节点列表），不存储文件的详细属性（如大小、修改时间）。这样设计既能将内存占用控制在极低水平，又能让列目录、找文件路径等高频操作在内存中直接完成，响应速度极快。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3299":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-16","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#1-设计目标与选型","content":"**RocksDB**：聚焦海量数据的可靠存储，承载所有文件/目录的完整详细信息，包括文件大小、权限、修改时间、数据块在磁盘中的位置等。通过列族分类管理不同类型的元数据，让数据组织更清晰，同时利用自身高并发读写特性，确保海量元数据的读写效率。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3300":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-17","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#1-设计目标与选型","content":"**协同逻辑**：采用“按需加载、分工响应”的方式。例如，当用户列某个目录的内容时，内存目录树先快速返回该目录下所有文件/文件夹的名称，确保响应速度；当用户需要查看某个文件的详细信息（如大小、修改时间）时，系统再去 RocksDB 中批量查询对应的详细信息，一次性返回，既保证了速度，又不浪费内存资源。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3301":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-18","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#3-raft-协议保障多节点数据一致的核心机制","content":"分布式集群的核心痛点是“数据不一致”——比如在一台机器上创建文件，另一台机器却无法查看，影响业务正常运行。Raft 协议作为 Curvine 分布式集群的“一致性中枢”，专门解决这一问题，核心机制简单且高效：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3302":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-19","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#3-raft-协议保障多节点数据一致的核心机制","content":"**日志同步优先**：任何元数据修改操作（创建、删除、重命名、修改属性等），都会先被封装为一条操作日志，存入专门的日志数据库，然后同步到集群中超过半数的机器上。只有多数机器都成功接收并存储这条日志，本次修改操作才算正式生效，确保数据不会因单台机器故障而丢失。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3303":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-20","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#3-raft-协议保障多节点数据一致的核心机制","content":"**日志回放保一致**：集群中的 Leader 节点负责发起修改操作、记录日志，Follower 节点（从节点）会实时同步 Leader 的日志，然后按照日志的顺序，逐一条执行相同的修改操作，确保所有节点的元数据状态完全一致，避免出现数据偏差。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3304":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-21","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#3-raft-协议保障多节点数据一致的核心机制","content":"**快照加速恢复**：如果某台机器因故障、断网等原因，落后 Leader 节点过多日志，无需逐一条回放所有历史日志，Leader 会直接发送当前数据的完整快照，该机器加载快照后就能快速追上集群进度，大幅缩短故障恢复时间，提升系统可用性。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3305":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-22","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#4-leader-优先写兼顾速度与一致性的巧妙权衡","content":"为了适配高并发、低延迟的业务场景，Curvine 对传统 Raft 协议的执行流程做了合理优化，采用“Leader 优先写”的策略，区别于传统“先同步日志、再改本地数据”的模式：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3306":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-23","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#4-leader-优先写兼顾速度与一致性的巧妙权衡","content":"**核心流程**：Leader 节点先更新自身的内存目录树 → 写入本地 RocksDB 完成本地数据修改 → 再将本次修改的日志同步给集群中的其他 Follower 节点，完成一致性同步。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3307":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-24","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#4-leader-优先写兼顾速度与一致性的巧妙权衡","content":"**核心优势**：写入速度大幅提升。无需等待日志同步到多数机器再完成本地修改，本地写入延迟可降低至几毫秒，高并发场景下（如大量小文件创建），吞吐量能提升数倍，完美适配高频小操作场景。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3308":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-25","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#4-leader-优先写兼顾速度与一致性的巧妙权衡","content":"**微小代价**：极短的一致性窗口。如果 Leader 节点刚完成本地修改，还未同步日志就发生故障，这部分未同步的修改可能无法同步到其他节点，但这个窗口极短（通常仅几毫秒），实际生产中出现的概率极低，是性能与一致性之间可接受的权衡。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3309":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-26","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#5-日志批处理优化进一步提升高并发吞吐量","content":"针对大量小文件创建、修改等高频小操作场景，Curvine 引入日志批处理机制，进一步提升写入吞吐量，避免频繁同步日志带来的性能损耗：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3310":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-27","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#5-日志批处理优化进一步提升高并发吞吐量","content":"核心逻辑是“攒一批、再同步”：系统会将短时间内（通常 1-10 毫秒）或一定数量（如 100 条）的元数据修改操作，合并为一个批量日志，再同步到集群其他节点。这样做的核心好处是减少日志同步的次数，降低网络传输和磁盘写入的开销，高并发场景下吞吐量可提升数倍。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3311":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-28","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#5-日志批处理优化进一步提升高并发吞吐量","content":"同时，批处理参数可灵活调整，可根据业务需求设置批处理的时间窗口（如 1 毫秒、5 毫秒）和批量条数（如 50 条、100 条），在写入延迟和吞吐量之间找到最优平衡——窗口越短，延迟越低；批量越大，吞吐量越高。此外，由于 Raft 日志已能保障数据一致性，RocksDB 自身的 WAL 日志是关闭的，进一步提升写入速度。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3312":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-29","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#6-选型取舍为何不采用-tidbredis-等外部数据库","content":"在元数据存储方案选型时，技术团队也重点评估了 TiDB、Redis 等成熟外部数据库，但最终选择自研“内存目录树 + RocksDB + 内置 Raft”的架构，核心原因是外部数据库无法适配 Curvine 高并发、低延迟的核心需求，具体取舍如下：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3313":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-30","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#6-选型取舍为何不采用-tidbredis-等外部数据库","content":"**延迟过高**：外部数据库需要通过网络通信完成读写，每次元数据操作都要多走一次网络，尾延迟会显著升高，远不如“内存+本地 RocksDB”的本地操作速度快，无法满足高频小操作的低延迟需求。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3314":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-31","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#6-选型取舍为何不采用-tidbredis-等外部数据库","content":"**易出现性能瓶颈**：元数据操作多为高频小请求，海量客户端同时连接外部数据库时，很容易打满数据库连接数，导致 QPS 触顶，无法支撑高并发场景。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3315":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-32","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#6-选型取舍为何不采用-tidbredis-等外部数据库","content":"**运维成本高且繁琐**：引入外部数据库会增加集群的依赖组件，需要额外部署、监控、维护这套数据库，故障恢复也更复杂；同时，随着元数据量增长，外部托管数据库的成本会大幅上升，不符合成本可控的目标。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3316":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-33","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#6-选型取舍为何不采用-tidbredis-等外部数据库","content":"**优化空间有限**：外部数据库是通用型设计，无法针对元数据的高频目录操作、批量读写等特点做定制化优化，而自研架构可深度优化路径解析、按需加载等核心流程，更贴合业务需求。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3317":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-34","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#7-fs-mode-模式与-ufs-协同保障数据兜底安全","content":"Curvine 支持 fs-mode 模式，核心作用是将元数据和文件数据同步到底层统一文件系统（UFS），形成“本地存储+磁盘兜底”的双重保障，避免数据丢失，同时不影响系统性能：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3318":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-35","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#7-fs-mode-模式与-ufs-协同保障数据兜底安全","content":"**元数据镜像同步**：Curvine 中的所有元数据修改（创建、删除、修改属性），都会在本地完成后，后台异步同步一份到 UFS，确保 Curvine 与 UFS 的目录结构、文件属性完全一致，实现统一命名空间。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3319":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-36","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#7-fs-mode-模式与-ufs-协同保障数据兜底安全","content":"**数据异步拷贝**：文件的实际数据块，会在后台异步从 Curvine 拷贝到 UFS，拷贝过程不影响本地元数据的读写操作，避免拖慢写入速度；若 UFS 暂时不可用，拷贝任务会自动重试，直到同步成功。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3320":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-37","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#7-fs-mode-模式与-ufs-协同保障数据兜底安全","content":"**幂等重试保障**：同步操作采用幂等设计，同一个修改操作重复执行，结果也不会发生变化，避免出现重复创建文件、重复删除等异常，确保同步过程的可靠性。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3321":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-38","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#7-fs-mode-模式与-ufs-协同保障数据兜底安全","content":"**进度跟踪与快速恢复**：系统会分别记录“Curvine 本地最新修改进度”和“UFS 同步进度”，若 UFS 因故障、断网落后过多，恢复后无需重新同步所有数据，只需从上次中断的进度继续同步，大幅提升恢复效率。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3322":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-39","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#8-架构小结","content":"Curvine 元数据架构的核心逻辑，可概括为“三层分工、一个权衡、一个兜底”，既保证了速度和海量存储，又兼顾了数据一致性和运维便捷性：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3323":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-40","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#8-架构小结","content":"**三层分工**：内存目录树管速度（高频操作秒响应），RocksDB 管存储（海量元数据稳承载），Raft 协议管一致（多节点数据无偏差），三者协同，实现“快而稳、省而全”；","locale":"zh-cn"},"3324":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-41","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#8-架构小结","content":"**一个权衡**：采用 Leader 优先写策略，以极短的一致性窗口，换取高并发场景下的低延迟和高吞吐量，适配大量小文件读写的核心场景；","locale":"zh-cn"},"3325":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-42","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#8-架构小结","content":"**一个兜底**：通过 fs-mode 模式与 UFS 协同，实现元数据和文件数据的双重备份，保障数据安全，同时支持快速故障恢复；","locale":"zh-cn"},"3326":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture-43","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/metadata-architecture#8-架构小结","content":"**选型优势**：放弃外部数据库，采用本地架构，既降低了延迟和运维成本，又保留了定制化优化空间，完美适配分布式文件系统的核心需求。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3327":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","type":"page","content":"OpenDAL 生态集成","breadcrumbs":["Documents","Architecture"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","locale":"zh-cn"},"3328":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-0","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#概述","content":"概述","locale":"zh-cn"},"3329":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-1","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#什么是-opendal","content":"什么是 OpenDAL？","locale":"zh-cn"},"3330":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-2","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#支持的存储后端","content":"支持的存储后端","locale":"zh-cn"},"3331":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-3","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#对象存储","content":"对象存储","locale":"zh-cn"},"3332":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-4","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#分布式文件系统","content":"分布式文件系统","locale":"zh-cn"},"3333":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-5","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#核心功能","content":"核心功能","locale":"zh-cn"},"3334":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-6","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#mount-功能---挂载外部存储","content":"Mount 功能 - 挂载外部存储","locale":"zh-cn"},"3335":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-7","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#s3-存储挂载示例","content":"S3 存储挂载示例","locale":"zh-cn"},"3336":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-8","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#其他存储类型挂载","content":"其他存储类型挂载","locale":"zh-cn"},"3337":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-9","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#load-功能---加载外部数据","content":"Load 功能 - 加载外部数据","locale":"zh-cn"},"3338":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-10","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#配置参数说明","content":"配置参数说明","locale":"zh-cn"},"3339":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-11","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#s3-兼容存储配置","content":"S3 兼容存储配置","locale":"zh-cn"},"3340":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-12","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#oss-配置","content":"OSS 配置","locale":"zh-cn"},"3341":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-13","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#hdfs-配置","content":"HDFS 配置","locale":"zh-cn"},"3342":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-14","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#hdfs-环境要求","content":"HDFS 环境要求","locale":"zh-cn"},"3343":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-15","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#编译要求","content":"编译要求","locale":"zh-cn"},"3344":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-16","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#运行环境要求","content":"运行环境要求","locale":"zh-cn"},"3345":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-17","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#概述","content":"Curvine 在核心层面集成了 OpenDAL（Open Data Access Layer，开放数据访问层），为 Curvine 提供强大的存储生态支持。这种集成使得 Curvine 能够与各种存储后端无缝协作，同时保持统一的接口。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3346":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-18","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#什么是-opendal","content":"OpenDAL 是一个数据访问层，提供统一的 API 来访问各种存储服务。它作为应用程序和存储系统之间的抽象层，提供：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3347":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-19","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#什么是-opendal","content":"**统一接口**：跨不同存储后端的一致 API","locale":"zh-cn"},"3348":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-20","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#什么是-opendal","content":"**多存储支持**：支持对象存储、文件系统、数据库等多种存储类型","locale":"zh-cn"},"3349":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-21","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#什么是-opendal","content":"**高性能**：优化的数据访问路径和缓存机制","locale":"zh-cn"},"3350":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-22","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#什么是-opendal","content":"**可扩展性**：轻松添加新的存储后端支持","locale":"zh-cn"},"3351":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-23","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#什么是-opendal","content":"**可靠性**：内置重试机制和错误处理","locale":"zh-cn"},"3352":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-24","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#支持的存储后端","content":"通过 OpenDAL 集成，Curvine 目前支持以下存储服务：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3353":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-25","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#对象存储","content":"**Amazon S3**：AWS 的对象存储服务，支持 `s3://` 和 `s3a://` 协议","locale":"zh-cn"},"3354":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-26","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#对象存储","content":"**阿里云 OSS**：阿里云对象存储服务，支持 `oss://` 协议","locale":"zh-cn"},"3355":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-27","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#对象存储","content":"**腾讯云 COS**：腾讯云对象存储，支持 `cos://` 协议","locale":"zh-cn"},"3356":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-28","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#对象存储","content":"**Azure Blob Storage**：Microsoft Azure 的对象存储，支持 `azblob://` 协议","locale":"zh-cn"},"3357":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-29","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#对象存储","content":"**Google Cloud Storage**：Google 云存储，支持 `gcs://` 和 `gs://` 协议","locale":"zh-cn"},"3358":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-30","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#分布式文件系统","content":"**HDFS