[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#二测试方案","content":"本次测试围绕 Curvine 两种核心挂载模式（fs-mode、cache-mode）展开，重点验证冷启动读取、Page Cache 命中读取及元数据缓存优化对性能的影响，同时以原生 MinIO 作为基准对照，全面评估 Curvine 小文件读取能力。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3641":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-20","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#1-fs-mode-测试流程","content":"挂载 Curvine 至指定目录：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3642":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-21","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#1-fs-mode-测试流程","content":"数据迁移：通过 `rclone` 将 70,000 张图片从本地 `/data/img/bdd` 拷贝至 Curvine 挂载目录。fs-mode 下，70,000 张图片通过 `rclone` 拷贝至 Curvine 挂载目录，总耗时 55 秒，传输效率稳定，满足大规模小文件快速接入需求。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3643":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-22","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#1-fs-mode-测试流程","content":"数据读取测试命令：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3644":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-23","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#1-fs-mode-测试流程","content":"元数据缓存优化测试：分别开启内核元数据缓存、客户端元数据缓存、双缓存。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3645":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-24","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#2-cache-mode-测试流程","content":"先通过 `mc` 命令将 70,000 张图片预拷贝至 MinIO 对应桶（`xuen/cache_mode`）。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3646":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-25","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#2-cache-mode-测试流程","content":"挂载 Curvine 至指定目录：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3647":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-26","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#2-cache-mode-测试流程","content":"读取测试命令：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3648":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-27","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#2-cache-mode-测试流程","content":"元数据缓存优化测试：分别开启内核元数据缓存、客户端元数据缓存、双缓存。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3649":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-28","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#四测试结果","content":"| 测试类型           | 处理速度（张/秒） | 性能提升对比（与 MinIO 冷读） |\n| -------------- | --------- | ------------------ |\n| MinIO 原生冷读（基准） | 1675      | -                  |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"3650":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-29","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#四测试结果","content":"| 测试类型        | 处理速度（张/秒） | 性能提升对比（与 MinIO 冷读） |\n| ----------- | --------- | ------------------ |\n| Curvine 基础版 | 5615      | +235.2%            |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"3651":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-30","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#四测试结果","content":"| 测试类型              | 处理速度（张/秒） | 性能提升对比（与 MinIO 冷读） |\n| ----------------- | --------- | ------------------ |\n| Curvine + 内核元数据缓存 | 5997      | +257.9%            |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"3652":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-31","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#四测试结果","content":"| 测试类型               | 处理速度（张/秒） | 性能提升对比（与 MinIO 冷读） |\n| ------------------ | --------- | ------------------ |\n| Curvine + 客户端元数据缓存 | 6174      | +268.6%            |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"3653":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-32","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#四测试结果","content":"| 测试类型             | 处理速度（张/秒） | 性能提升对比（与 MinIO 冷读） |\n| ---------------- | --------- | ------------------ |\n| Curvine + 双元数据缓存 | 6117      | +265.2%            |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"3654":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-33","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#五测试结论","content":"远超原生存储：Curvine 最优读取性能达 6174 张/秒，是原生 MinIO（1675 张/秒）的 3.68 倍；基础版性能 5615 张/秒，已是原生 MinIO 的 3.35 倍","locale":"zh-cn"},"3655":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-34","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#五测试结论","content":"元数据缓存增益显著：开启元数据缓存后，性能较 Curvine 基础版提升 6.8%~10.0%，其中客户端元数据缓存优化效果最佳","locale":"zh-cn"},"3656":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-35","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#五测试结论","content":"元数据机制高效：Curvine 原生基础版已实现 5615 张/秒的高性能读取，无需依赖缓存即可满足 AI 小文件读取需求，降低配置复杂度与运维成本","locale":"zh-cn"},"3657":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-36","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#五测试结论","content":"模式兼容性强：fs-mode、cache-mode 均能稳定发挥高性能，适配不同业务场景的存储需求，兼顾性能与灵活性","locale":"zh-cn"},"3658":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/benchmark-guide","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/benchmark-guide","type":"page","content":"压测指南","breadcrumbs":["Documents","Contributor Guide"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/benchmark-guide","locale":"zh-cn"},"3659":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/benchmark-guide-0","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/benchmark-guide","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/benchmark-guide#开始前准备","content":"开始前准备","locale":"zh-cn"},"3660":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/benchmark-guide-1","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Co