:"zh-cn"},"4533":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Overview-10","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Overview#部署顺序","content":"逐步在需要切换的客户端启用 Transfer。未启用的客户端在灰度期间仍可使用旧的\nMaster Job 路径。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4534":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Overview-11","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Overview#文档边界","content":"集群部署页面说明 Master、Worker、存储和网络。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4535":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Overview-12","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Overview#文档边界","content":"Transfer 页面说明独立调度器、状态存储和客户端路由。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4536":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Overview-13","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Overview#文档边界","content":"配置参考\n是默认值的唯一来源；部署页面只展示对应拓扑的必填项。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4537":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Overview-14","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Overview#生产变更","content":"升级应作为独立操作执行。修改线上集群前，先在非生产环境验证版本兼容性和配置变更。\n如果需要运行多个 Transfer 实例，必须使用共享的 MySQL Store。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4538":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal","type":"page","content":"物理机部署 Transfer","breadcrumbs":["Documents","部署","Transfer 服务"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal","locale":"zh-cn"},"4539":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal-0","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal#准备服务配置","content":"准备服务配置","locale":"zh-cn"},"4540":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal-1","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal#启动与停止","content":"启动与停止","locale":"zh-cn"},"4541":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal-2","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal#使用-systemd-运行","content":"使用 systemd 运行","locale":"zh-cn"},"4542":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal-3","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal#验证","content":"验证","locale":"zh-cn"},"4543":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal-4","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal#高可用","content":"高可用","locale":"zh-cn"},"4544":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal-5","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal","content":"本指南在现有 Curvine 集群旁部署一个独立的 Transfer 进程。Master 和 Worker 必须已经\n运行，并且使用支持 Transfer task 的版本。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4545":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal-6","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal#准备服务配置","content":"以已包含 Master 地址的集群配置为基础，创建一份仅供 Transfer 使用的副本。下面的\n`[transfer]` 是单实例 SQLite 部署唯一需要新增的配置段。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4546":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal-7","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal#准备服务配置","content":"使用运行服务的同一个操作系统用户创建 Store 目录。SQLite 数据库必须位于持久化本地盘\n或块存储上；不要放在共享文件系统上，也不要再启动第二个进程访问该数据库。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4547":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal-8","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal#启动与停止","content":"发行包包含 Transfer 启动脚本。它会加载 `curvine-env.sh`，写入\n`logs/transfer.out`，并维护 `transfer.pid`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4548":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal-9","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal#使用-systemd-运行","content":"使用发行包内置脚本，以便服务拥有正常的 Curvine shell 环境。将下列内容保存为\n`/etc/systemd/system/curvine-transfer.service`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4549":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal-10","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal#验证","content":"客户端地址必须可被所有 CLI 使用者和可能执行 Transfer task 的 Worker 访问。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4550":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal-11","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Bare-Metal#高可用","content":"运行多个 Transfer 进程时，将 SQLite URL 改为一个共享的 MySQL `store_url`。每个进程\n必须具有唯一且可访问的地址，并通过负载均衡或 DNS 向客户端提供一个稳定地址。不要将\n多个彼此独立的 SQLite 数据库作为故障切换目标。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4551":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes","type":"page","content":"Kubernetes 部署 Transfer","breadcrumbs":["Documents","部署","Transfer 服务"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes","locale":"zh-cn"},"4552":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes-0","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes#前置条件","content":"前置条件","locale":"zh-cn"},"4553":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes-1","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes#sqlite-单副本清单","content":"SQLite 单副本清单","locale":"zh-cn"},"4554":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes-2","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes#配置客户端","content":"配置客户端","locale":"zh-cn"},"4555":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes-3","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes#mysql-多副本部署","content":"MySQL 多副本部署","locale":"zh-cn"},"4556":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes-4","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes","content":"Transfer 与 Master、Worker 独立部署。当前 Curvine Helm Chart 不会创建该服务，因此应\n使用单独的清单。下方 SQLite 清单固定为单副本，并使用专用 RWO 卷。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4557":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes-5","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes#前置条件","content":"命名空间中已部署 Curvine Master 和 Worker。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4558":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes-6","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes#前置条件","content":"存在包含 `curvine-cluster.toml` 键的集群配置 ConfigMap。示例使用\n`curvine-cluster-config`，请替换为实际名称。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4559":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes-7","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes#前置条件","content":"集群存在支持 `ReadWriteOnce` 的默认 `StorageClass`，或者在 PVC 上配置\n`storageClassName`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4560":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes-8","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes#前置条件","content":"镜像版本与 Master、Worker 一致。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4561":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes-9","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes#sqlite-单副本清单","content":"将下列内容保存为 `transfer-sqlite.yaml`，并替换镜像和命名空间。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4562":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes-10","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes#sqlite-单副本清单","content":"主容器只能挂载生成后的 `curvine-cluster.toml` 文件。若用 `emptyDir` 覆盖整个\n`/app/curvine/conf`，会遮蔽镜像中的 `curvine-env.sh`，导致发行包内置客户端脚本异常。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4563":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes-11","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes#sqlite-单副本清单","content":"应用并验证服务：","locale":"zh-cn"},"4564":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes-12","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes#配置客户端","content":"集群内客户端使用 Service DNS：","locale":"zh-cn"},"4565":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes-13","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes#配置客户端","content":"集群外客户端必须使用自身可访问的地址；`.svc.cluster.local` 仅在集群网络内可用。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4566":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes-14","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Kubernetes#mysql-多副本部署","content":"如需运行多个 Transfer 副本，应通过 Secret 提供共享 MySQL `store_url`，移除 SQLite\nPVC，并让所有副本使用同一个 ClusterIP Service。所有副本必须使用同一数据库和兼容的\n镜像版本。不要将 SQLite Deployment 扩容到一个以上副本。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4567":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview","type":"page","content":"Transfer 服务","breadcrumbs":["Documents","部署","Transfer 服务"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview","locale":"zh-cn"},"4568":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview-0","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview#配置边界","content":"配置边界","locale":"zh-cn"},"4569":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview-1","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview#选择状态存储","content":"选择状态存储","locale":"zh-cn"},"4570":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview-2","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview#必填配置","content":"必填配置","locale":"zh-cn"},"4571":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview-3","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview#部署与验证","content":"部署与验证","locale":"zh-cn"},"4572":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview-4","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview#灰度与回滚","content":"灰度与回滚","locale":"zh-cn"},"4573":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview-5","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview","content":"Transfer 是用于 Load 和 Export 任务的独立服务。它持久化任务状态，基于 mount 和\nWorker 信息规划任务，向 Worker 下发任务并接收回报。它不会保存完整 Curvine 元数据树\n的副本。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4574":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview-6","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview","content":"应在 Master 和 Worker 健康后再部署 Transfer。它是可选服务：未启用 Transfer 的集群\n继续使用原有的 Master Load 和 Export 路径。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4575":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview-7","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview#配置边界","content":"服务端与客户端使用不同的 Transfer 配置。部署 Transfer 时，不要修改正在运行的 Master\n或 Worker 配置。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4576":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview-8","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview#配置边界","content":"| 组件          | 必需变更                                                        | 说明                        |\n| ----------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| Transfer 服务 | 配置 `transfer.enabled = true`、持久化 `store_url` 和可访问 endpoint。 | 服务配置还必须包含现有集群的 Master 地址。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"4577":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview-9","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview#配置边界","content":"| 组件            | 必需变更                                                 | 说明                                               |\n| ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| CLI 或 SDK 客户端 | 配置 `transfer.enabled = true` 和 `transfer.endpoints`。 | `cv load`、`cv export` 及兼容的查询/取消命令会自动使用 Transfer。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"4578":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview-10","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview#配置边界","content":"| 组件     | 必需变更                   | 说明                                 |\n| ------ | ---------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| Master | 无。灰度期间保持 Transfer 未启用。 | 启用后 Master 会拒绝旧 Load 和 Export RPC。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"4579":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview-11","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview#配置边界","content":"| 组件     | 必需变更 | 说明                                                 |\n| ------ | ---- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| Worker | 无。   | Worker 只需使用支持 Transfer task 的版本；回报 endpoint 随任务下发。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"4580":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview-12","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview#配置边界","content":"客户端配置中不需要数据库 URL。状态存储只属于 Transfer 服务端。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4581":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview-13","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview#选择状态存储","content":"| Store  | 拓扑                       | 适用场景         |\n| ------ | ------------------------ | ------------ |\n| SQLite | 一个 Transfer 实例和一个持久化本地卷。 | 评估、开发或单实例部署。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"4582":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview-14","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview#选择状态存储","content":"| Store | 拓扑                         | 适用场景        |\n| ----- | -------------------------- | ----------- |\n| MySQL | 两个及以上 Transfer 实例共享同一个数据库。 | 生产高可用和滚动升级。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"4583":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview-15","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview#选择状态存储","content":"不要让多个 Transfer 实例使用彼此独立的 SQLite 文件。它们会持有不同的 Job 状态，无法\n正确故障切换。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4584":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview-16","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview#必填配置",