cv load <path> --watch`，确认任务进入 `Completed`，并使用\n`cv fs --cache-only get` 读取目标。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4592":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview-24","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service/Overview#灰度与回滚","content":"按客户端逐步启用 Transfer。`transfer.enabled = false` 的客户端继续调用旧 Master Job\nAPI，因此单独部署 Transfer 不会改变已有工作负载。回滚客户端时只需关闭该客户端的\nTransfer；存在运行中任务时，不要删除 Transfer Store。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4593":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service","type":"page","content":"Transfer Service","breadcrumbs":["Documents","部署","Transfer 服务"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Transfer-Service","locale":"zh-cn"},"4594":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/build-instructions","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/build-instructions","type":"page","content":"构建指南","breadcrumbs":["Documents","部署"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/build-instructions","locale":"zh-cn"},"4595":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/build-instructions-0","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/build-instructions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/build-instructions#先决条件","content":"先决条件","locale":"zh-cn"},"4596":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/build-instructions-1","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/build-instructions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/build-instructions#构建步骤linux---ubuntudebian-示例","content":"构建步骤（Linux - Ubuntu/Debian 示例）","locale":"zh-cn"},"4597":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/build-instructions-2","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/build-instructions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/build-instructions#启动单节点集群","content":"启动单节点集群","locale":"zh-cn"},"4598":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/build-instructions-3","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/build-instructions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/build-instructions","content":"本页内容与仓库 README 中的构建指南保持一致。如需完整的编译指南（Docker 编译、UFS 模块、安装包打包等），请参考下载和编译 Curvine。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4599":{"id":"/zh-cn