er-Manuals/Access/sdk#概览","content":"概览","locale":"zh-cn"},"5006":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-1","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#rust-sdk","content":"Rust SDK","locale":"zh-cn"},"5007":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-2","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#java-sdk","content":"Java SDK","locale":"zh-cn"},"5008":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-3","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#python-sdk","content":"Python SDK","locale":"zh-cn"},"5009":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-4","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#通用配置","content":"通用配置","locale":"zh-cn"},"5010":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-5","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","content":"Curvine 提供多语言 SDK，使应用可通过 RPC 访问 Curvine 文件系统（元数据访问 Master，块数据访问 Worker），而无需使用 FUSE 或 S3 网关。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5011":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-6","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#概览","content":"| SDK      | 包 / 模块                              | 适用场景             |\n| -------- | ----------------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| **Rust** | `curvine-client` / `curvine-libsdk` | 原生 Rust 应用、高性能场景 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"5012":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-7","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#概览","content":"| SDK      | 包 / 模块                                                     | 适用场景                        |\n| -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **Java** | Hadoop 兼容 FileSystem（`fs.cv://`）、curvine-libsdk 的 Java SDK | Hadoop/Spark/Flink 等 JVM 应用 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"5013":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-8","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#概览","content":"| SDK        | 包 / 模块                     | 适用场景          |\n| ---------- | -------------------------- | ------------- |\n| **Python** | curvine-libsdk 的 Python 绑定 | 机器学习、数据流水线、脚本 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"5014":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-9","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#概览","content":"所有 SDK 均需在 Curvine 集群（Master 与 Worker）已启动、且客户端配置正确（如 `curvine-cluster.toml` 中的 `master_addrs`）的前提下使用。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5015":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-10","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#rust-sdk","content":"通过 `curvine-client`（或 `curvine-libsdk` 暴露的 Rust API）编程式创建文件、读写数据、列举目录。配置通常从 `curvine-cluster.toml` 或环境变量加载。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5016":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-11","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#rust-sdk","content":"构建与用法参见 开发指南 及 Curvine 源码仓库（如 `curvine-client`、`curvine-libsdk` 及 `curvine-tests` 下的集成测试）。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5017":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-12","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#java-sdk","content":"**Hadoop FileSystem**：在 `core-site.xml` 或 `curvine-site.xml` 中配置 `fs.cv.impl` 与 `fs.cv.master_addrs`，使 `FileSystem.get(URI.create(\"curvine:///path\"), conf)` 使用 Curvine。`fs.cv.master_addrs` 配置见 部署准备。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5018":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-13","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#java-sdk","content":"**Java API**：在不使用 Hadoop FileSystem 时，可使用 curvine-libsdk 的 Java SDK 直接通过 RPC 访问。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5019":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-14","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#java-sdk","content":"兼容 Hadoop、Spark、Flink 等支持自定义 FileSystem 的 JVM 框架。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5020":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-15","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#python-sdk","content":"Python SDK（来自 curvine-libsdk）提供读写文件、列举目录等原生 API，适用于 ML 训练、数据预处理和自动化脚本。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5021":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-16","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#python-sdk","content":"安装与示例见 Curvine 源码仓库及 开发指南。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5022":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-17","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#通用配置","content":"**Master 地址**：在集群配置（如 `curvine-cluster.toml`）中设置 `client.master_addrs`，或在各 SDK 中传入等价配置（如 Java 的 `fs.cv.master_addrs`）。格式：`host1:8995,host2:8995`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5023":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-18","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#通用配置","content":"**配置文件**：多数 SDK 支持传入配置文件路径（如 `conf/curvine-cluster.toml`），与 CLI（`cv`）、FUSE、S3 网关共用同一配置。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5024":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-19","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#通用配置","content":"若需 UFS（统一文件系统）访问，请先用 `cv mount` 挂载 UFS 路径；随后在对应 Curvine 路径上的 SDK 操作语义与 数据编排 一致。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5025":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Deployment","page_id":"