/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#实际行为","content":"每个 Pod 会把自己的主机名、时间戳和 PVC 名称写入 `index.html`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5274":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-18","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#实际行为","content":"CSI Controller 会为每个 PVC 动态创建对应的 Curvine 目录。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5275":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-19","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#实际行为","content":"CSI Node Plugin 再把对应目录挂载到对应的 Pod 中。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5276":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-20","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#实际行为","content":"因此，虽然这些副本共用同一个 CSI 驱动和同一个 `StorageClass`，但应用层看到的是彼此独立的数据目录。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5277":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-21","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#校验-pvc-隔离","content":"查看每个副本写出的内容：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5278":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-22","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#校验-pvc-隔离","content":"输出里应该能看到不同的主机名和 PVC 名称。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5279":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-23","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#校验持久性","content":"如果 Pod 重建后仍能看到 `retained`，说明 StatefulSet 已正确复用原来的 PVC。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5280":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Use