zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#兼容-clidfs","content":"当第一个子命令是 `fs` 或 `report` 时，它会调用 Java `io.curvine.CurvineShell`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5706":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-167","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#兼容-clidfs","content":"`dfs fs` 保留 Hadoop `FsShell` 风格，因此子命令写法是 `-ls`、`-mkdir`、`-rm -r` 这种单短横线形式。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5707":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-168","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#兼容-clidfs","content":"其它子命令最终仍会转发到 Rust `curvine-cli`，但日常运维建议直接使用 `cv`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5708":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-169","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#兼容-clidfs","content":"示例：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5709":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-170","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#兼容-clidfs","content":"其中 `dfs report info` 对应 Java 兼容入口的完整文本概览；语义上接近 `cv report all`，但命令名并不相同。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5710":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-171","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#兼容-clidfs","content":"如果你需要 HDFS Shell 兼容语义或依赖 Hadoop 配置文件（如 `core-site.xml` / `hdfs-site.xml`），使用 `dfs` 更合适；如果你需要 Curvine 当前源码里的完整命令集，优先使用 `cv`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5711":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-172","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#posix--fuse","content":"Curvine 提供 FUSE 文件系统接口。挂载后（例如通过 `bin/curvine-fuse.sh start`），可以在挂载点直接使用标准 Linux 命令：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5712":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Man