              | Solution                                    |\n| ------------------------------------- | --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| Using `localhost` in distributed mode | Workers cannot reach Master | Set proper hostnames via env vars or config |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-7"},"6090":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices-119","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices#10-common-pitfalls-and-troubleshooting","content":"| Pitfall                                  | Symptom                    | Solution                                              |\n| ---------------------------------------- | -------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| Renaming large S3 directories in fs_mode | Operation blocks for hours | Avoid rename on object storage; copy + delete instead |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-7"},"6091":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices-120","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices#10-common-pitfalls-and-troubleshooting","content":"| Pitfall                         | Symptom                        | Solution                                             |\n| ------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| TTL too short for training data | Cache thrashing, low hit ratio | Increase `--ttl-ms` to match training epoch duration |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-7"},"6092":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices-121","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices#10-common-pitfalls-and-troubleshooting","content":"| Pitfall             | Symptom             | Solution                                 |\n| ------------------- | ----------